#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:3
msgid "水素原子を並べると電子バンドは生まれるのか"
msgstr "Do Electronic Bands Form in a Hydrogen Atom Chain?"

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:5
msgid "固体物理の教科書では、原子がたくさん集まると、原子の離散的なエネルギー準位が密集して「バンド」になると説明されます。この過程を、実際の電子状態計算で確かめてみましょう。"
msgstr ""
"Solid-state physics textbooks explain that when many atoms come together,"
" their discrete energy levels crowd together to form a band. Let's follow"
" this process in an actual electronic structure calculation."

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:16
msgid "計算対象と計算条件"
msgstr "Systems and Calculation Conditions"

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:18
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"計算するのは、等間隔に一直線に並んだ中性の水素原子鎖 :math:`\\mathrm{H}_N` です（ :numref:`fig-hchain-"
"model` ）。\\ 隣り合う水素原子の間隔はすべて1.8 Åとし、原子核の位置は最適化せずに固定します。\\ "
"鎖の両端は開いており、周期境界条件は課しません。\\ これを\\ :numref:`tab-hchain-conditions`\\ "
"にあるような設定で、量子化学計算ソフト Psi4 [1]_ を用いて「分子」として計算します。"
msgstr ""
"The system is a neutral hydrogen atom chain :math:`\\mathrm{H}_N` with "
"equally spaced atoms in a straight line (:numref:`fig-hchain-model`). \\ "
"All neighboring hydrogen atoms are 1.8 Å apart, and the nuclear positions"
" are held fixed without optimization. \\ The chain has open ends, with no"
" periodic boundary conditions. \\ We use the calculation conditions in \\"
" :numref:`tab-hchain-conditions` \\ to treat the chain as a molecule with"
" the quantum chemistry software Psi4 [1]_."

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:27
msgid ""
"計算モデルの模式図。隣接原子間の距離を1.8 Åに保ち、原子核を固定したまま原子数 :math:`N` "
"を増やします。原子を結ぶ線は並び方を示すためのもので、化学結合を表すものではありません。"
msgstr ""
"This schematic shows the model used in the calculations. We increase the "
"number of atoms :math:`N` while keeping the nuclei fixed and neighboring "
"atoms 1.8 Å apart. The lines show how the atoms are arranged and do not "
"represent chemical bonds."

