"に対するものです。係数を比較し、フェルミ準位付近の準位間隔を対応させると、\\ 有効ホッピングは"
msgstr ""
"whose left-hand expression is exact for a half-filled chain with even "
":math:`N`, \\ whereas the approximation on the right applies at large "
":math:`N`. Comparing coefficients to match the level spacing near the "
"Fermi level \\ gives the effective hopping"

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:196
#, python-brace-format
msgid "t \\approx 11.75/(2\\pi) \\approx 1.87\\ \\mathrm{eV}"
msgstr "t \\approx 11.75/(2\\pi) \\approx 1.87\\ \\mathrm{eV}"

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:200
msgid ""
"になります。\\ この模型のバンド幅 :math:`4t \\approx 7.48` eV は、\\ :numref:`fig-hchain-"
"pbe-levels` から読み取れる、\\ RKS-PBEの :math:`N` = 64での軌道エネルギーの最大値と最小値の差、約 8.01 "
"eVに近い値です。\\"
msgstr ""
"for this model. \\ The model bandwidth of :math:`4t \\approx 7.48` eV is "
"close to the span of orbital energies in \\ :numref:`fig-hchain-pbe-"
"levels`, \\ where the highest and lowest RKS-PBE orbital energies for "
":math:`N` = 64 differ by about 8.01 eV.\\"

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:206
msgid "一方、RHFでは :math:`N` = 64まで増やしても約4.8 eVのギャップが残ります。"
msgstr "In contrast, an RHF gap of about 4.8 eV remains even at :math:`N` = 64."

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:210
msgid "波動関数（分子軌道）の解析"
msgstr "Wave Function (Molecular Orbital) Analysis"

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:212
msgid ""
"あらためて、2つの手法で計算した :math:`N` = 64の軌道エネルギーを並べてプロットしたものを :numref:`fig-hchain-"
"levels-n64` に示します。\\ PBEの準位は半充填位置 :math:`ka = \\pi/2` "
"をはさんで大きな段差なく並ぶのに対し、RHFでは占有軌道と空軌道の間に大きな段差があります。\\ "
"同じ原子配置と電子数なのに、なぜこれほど違う結果になるのでしょうか？"
msgstr ""
"For :math:`N` = 64, :numref:`fig-hchain-levels-n64` plots the orbital "
"energies from both methods together. \\ The PBE levels show no large step"
" across half filling at :math:`ka = \\pi/2`, whereas RHF shows a large "
"step between the occupied and unoccupied orbitals. \\ Why do the results "
"differ so much for the same atomic arrangement and electron count?"

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:220
msgid ""
":math:`N` = 64でのRHFとRKS-PBEの分子軌道エネルギー。塗りつぶしは占有軌道、白抜きは空軌道です。軸の定義は :numref"
":`fig-hchain-pbe-levels` と同じです。"
msgstr ""
"These are the RHF and RKS-PBE molecular orbital energies for :math:`N` = "
"64. Filled markers indicate occupied orbitals, and open markers indicate "
"unoccupied orbitals. The axes are defined as in :numref:`fig-hchain-pbe-"
"levels`."

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:224
msgid ""
"原因を探るため、隣り合う原子の間の電子的な結びつきを調べます。\\ 重なり行列 :math:`S` と（スピンについて和をとった）密度行列 "
":math:`D` から、Löwdin直交化した密度行列"
msgstr ""
"To investigate the cause, we examine electronic bonding between "
"neighboring atoms. \\ From the overlap matrix :math:`S` and the spin-"
"summed density matrix :math:`D`, we form the Löwdin-orthogonalized "
"density matrix"

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:227
msgid "P^{\\mathrm{L}} = S^{1/2} D S^{1/2}"
msgstr "P^{\\mathrm{L}} = S^{1/2} D S^{1/2}"

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:231
msgid "をつくり、その隣接原子間の要素を **結合次数に相当する量**"
msgstr ""
"and use its element between neighboring atoms as a **measure "
"corresponding to the bond order**"

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:233
msgid "B_i = P^{\\mathrm{L}}_{i,i+1}"
msgstr "B_i = P^{\\mathrm{L}}_{i,i+1}"

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:238
msgid "として使います（これはこの解析のための指標で、結合次数の唯一の定義ではありません）。\\ 例えば、最近接強束縛模型の場合であれば、波動関数"
msgstr ""
"(an indicator for this analysis, not the only definition of bond order). "
"\\ For example, in the nearest-neighbor tight-binding model, we use the "
"wave function"

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:241
msgid "\\phi_j(i) = \\sqrt{\\frac{2}{N+1}}\\sin\\left(\\frac{ij\\pi}{N+1}\\right)"
msgstr "\\phi_j(i) = \\sqrt{\\frac{2}{N+1}}\\sin\\left(\\frac{ij\\pi}{N+1}\\right)"

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:245
msgid "を使って以下のような評価を行うことになります。"
msgstr "to evaluate the bond order as follows."

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:247
#, python-brace-format
msgid " B_i = 2\\sum_{j=1}^{N/2}\\phi_j(i)\\phi_j(i+1)."
msgstr " B_i = 2\\sum_{j=1}^{N/2}\\phi_j(i)\\phi_j(i+1)."

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:252
msgid "結合次数の解析結果を :numref:`fig-hchain-bond-order` に示します。"
msgstr ""
":numref:`fig-hchain-bond-order` shows the results of the bond-order "
"analysis."

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:258
msgid ""
":math:`N` = 32の各結合におけるLöwdin密度行列要素（式 :eq:`lowdin-bi` ）。Uniform "
"TBは電子間相互作用を含まない一様な最近接強束縛模型の場合（式 :eq:`lowdin-bi-tb` ）。"
msgstr ""
"For each bond at :math:`N` = 32, the plot shows the Löwdin nearest-"
"neighbor density matrix element (Equation :eq:`lowdin-bi`). The curve "
"labeled “Uniform TB (no interaction)” shows the result for the uniform "
"nearest-neighbor tight-binding model without electron-electron "
"interactions (Equation :eq:`lowdin-bi-tb`)."

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:278
msgid ""
"RHFでは、鎖の中央でも :math:`B_i` がおおよそ0.86、0.38、0.86、0.38、……と大きく交替しています。\\ "
"PBEでは0.67と0.61程度の小さな交替にとどまります。これは、水素原子間の結合の強さが、\\ :numref:`fig-hchain-"
"bond-order-image` のようになっていることを示しています。"
msgstr ""
"In RHF, :math:`B_i` alternates strongly even at the center of the chain, "
"with values of roughly 0.86, 0.38, 0.86, 0.38, and so on. \\ In PBE, "
"however, the alternation is small, between about 0.67 and 0.61. The "
"corresponding pattern in bonding strength between hydrogen atoms is "
"illustrated in \\ :numref:`fig-hchain-bond-order-image`."

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:285
msgid ""
":math:`N` = 32の水素鎖中央における結合次数の交替を表す模式図。数値は隣接原子間のLöwdin密度行列要素 :math:`B_i` "
"の代表値です。原子間距離は一定で、青と橙はそれぞれ大きい値と小さい値を示します。"
msgstr ""
"This schematic shows the alternation of bond orders at the center of the "
":math:`N` = 32 hydrogen chain. The numbers are representative values of "
"the Löwdin density matrix element :math:`B_i` between neighboring atoms. "
"The interatomic spacing is constant. Blue indicates larger values and "
"orange indicates smaller values."

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:291
msgid ""
"このように、 **原子核は等間隔のまま、電子による結合の強さだけが「強・弱・強・弱」と交替する状態** は、\\ 結合次数波あるいは結合秩序波"
"（bond-order wave、BOW）と呼ばれています\\ （原子そのものが交互に変位する Peierls 歪みとは区別が必要です）。"
msgstr ""
"A state in which **the nuclei remain equally spaced and only the "
"electronic bond strengths alternate in a “strong, weak, strong, weak” "
"pattern** is \\ called a bond-order wave (BOW). \\ It must be "
"distinguished from a Peierls distortion, in which the atoms themselves "
"undergo alternating displacements."

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:295
msgid ""
"BOW状態が無限鎖でも保たれるとすると、電子状態の周期は :math:`a` から :math:`2a` に倍化します。\\ "
"これは、強弱2種類のホッピング :math:`t_1, t_2` を交互に並べた Su-Schrieffer-Heeger (SSH) 模型 "
"[5]_ と呼ばれる強束縛模型で記述できる状態となっており、\\ 簡単な計算から、折り返されたバンドの境界に"
msgstr ""
"If the BOW state persists in an infinite chain, the period of the "
"electronic state doubles from :math:`a` to :math:`2a`. \\ A tight-binding"
" model with alternating strong and weak hoppings :math:`t_1, t_2`, known "
"as the Su–Schrieffer–Heeger (SSH) model [5]_, can describe this state. \\"
" A simple calculation shows that a gap of"

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:299
msgid "\\Delta_{\\mathrm{BOW}} = 2|t_1 - t_2|"
msgstr "\\Delta_{\\mathrm{BOW}} = 2|t_1 - t_2|"

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:303
msgid ""
"のギャップが開くことが示されます。\\ :numref:`fig-hchain-levels-n64` で、RHFの準位が半充填位置 "
":math:`ka = \\pi/2` で段差を持つことも、この描像と整合しています。"
msgstr ""
"opens at the boundary of the folded band. \\ :numref:`fig-hchain-"
"levels-n64` also shows a step in the RHF levels at half filling :math:`ka"
" = \\pi/2`, consistent with this picture."

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:311
msgid "スピン分極を考慮した場合"
msgstr "Including Spin Polarization"

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:313
msgid ""
"ここまでの計算は、上向きスピンと下向きスピンの電子に同じ空間軌道を使わせるスピン制限計算でした。\\ そこで"
"、両スピンの軌道を独立に最適化できるUHFとUKS-PBEでも計算してみました。\\ バンド風プロットの結果を :numref:`fig-"
"hchain-uhf-spectrum` および :numref:`fig-hchain-uks-spectrum` に示します。"
msgstr ""
"So far, the calculations have been spin-restricted calculations, with the"
" same spatial orbitals for spin-up and spin-down electrons. \\ We "
"therefore also ran UHF and UKS-PBE calculations, which can optimize the "
"orbitals for the two spins independently. \\ The band-like plots are "
"shown in :numref:`fig-hchain-uhf-spectrum` and :numref:`fig-hchain-uks-"
"spectrum`."

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:323
msgid "UHFの軌道エネルギー。横軸は軌道番号から割り当てた擬似波数で、塗りつぶしは占有軌道、白抜きは空軌道を示します。"
msgstr ""
"These are the UHF orbital energies. The horizontal axis shows the pseudo "
"wave number assigned by orbital order. Filled markers indicate occupied "
"orbitals, and open markers indicate unoccupied orbitals."

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:329
msgid "UKS-PBEの軌道エネルギー。横軸と記号の意味は左図と同じですが、縦軸の範囲は異なります。"
msgstr ""
"These are the UKS-PBE orbital energies. The horizontal axis and the "
"markers have the same meanings as in the plot on the left, but the "
"vertical range differs."

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:331
msgid ""
"図では、 :math:`\\alpha` スピンと :math:`\\beta` スピンの軌道エネルギーが重なっています。\\ そして今度は "
"UHF と UKS-PBE の両方で大きなHOMO–LUMO軌道ギャップが現れています。\\ :numref:`tab-hchain-spin` "
"に、HOMO–LUMO軌道ギャップと\\ Löwdinスピン密度（原子ごとのα電子数とβ電子数の差）の平均絶対値を示します。\\ "
"非制限解での平均絶対値は 0.6 :math:`\\sim` 0.9 です。"
msgstr ""
"The plots show overlapping :math:`\\alpha`- and :math:`\\beta`-spin "
"orbital energies. \\ Both UHF and UKS-PBE now show a large HOMO–LUMO "
"orbital gap. \\ :numref:`tab-hchain-spin` gives the HOMO–LUMO orbital gap"
" and \\ the mean absolute Löwdin spin density. The spin density at each "
"atom is its α electron population minus its β electron population. \\ The"
" mean absolute value is 0.6 :math:`\\sim` 0.9 for the unrestricted "
"solutions."

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/band_formation.rst:337
msgid ":math:`N` = 32でのスピン制限解と非制限解の比較（PK積分）"
msgstr ""
"Comparison of spin-restricted and spin-unrestricted solutions at "
":math:`N` = 32 (PK integrals)"

